Bluecurve theme ported to Qt 5/6

Requirements:
- Qt 5/6 qtbase development files.
- KDE Extra CMake Modules package.

You can choose if you also want to build for QT5 besides QT6:

  QT5=yes  build for QT5 (default)
  QT5=no   do not build for QT5

Pass the script the parameter you prefer, like
  QT5=no ./Bluecurve-Qt.SlackBuild
